QuestGuidance.Register("en",292,{
[9313]="700303ED\n1\tBurn Orc-tents (total: 7)\tOrc-tents can be found in the White Hand encampment at the north-east edge of Fangorn. You should burn many tents so that the Orcs do not get too comfortable settling in at their cruel encampment.\n",
[9314]="70067C4F\n1\tDefeat Haradrim in the western Cape of Umbar ([see journal]/18)\030Post the message to the Haradrim in the camp of Grijâti\tGirgish provided you with a letter you should post within the Haradrim encampment located to the south and west of Jax Phanâl. She also instructed you to eliminate a number of the enemies within the camp so that the proper message is sent to the unwelcome squatters.\n2\tReturn to Girgish at Jax Phanâl\tWith the grisly aspect of the task done and the message to the Haradrim posted, it is time to return to Girgish at Jax Phanâl.\n",
[9315]="70046C21\n1\tLay traps around Henneth Annûn (total: 8)\tIdeal trap locations can be found around the eastern entrance to Henneth Annûn. Rhadrog has asked you to lay traps for deer and Orcs alike in the lands around Henneth Annûn.\n2\tTalk to Rhadrog in Henneth Annûn\tRhadrog can be found in Henneth Annûn. You have laid many traps on behalf of the Rangers of Ithilien. You should now return to Rhadrog.\n",
[9316]="7005A5FC\n1\tCollect twistbeard (total: 5)\tLúka has asked you to collect some twistbeard. Twistbeard can be found on rocks in Tharkh Shathur, to the south-east of Ashmargathâl.\n2\tTalk to Lúka\tYou have collected all the twistbeard you could find. You should return to Ashmargathâl and give the twistbeard to Lúka.\n3\tLúka has asked you to clean the wounds of injured scouts. The scouts are resting around Ashmargathâl.\t\n4\tTalk to Lúka\tYou should let Lúka know that you have cleaned the scouts' wounds.\n",
[9317]="700307DE\n1\tFollow the trail of footprints off the road to Snowbourn\t\n2\tFollow the trail of footprints off the road to Snowbourn\tYou have found a trail of footprints off the side of the road south to Snowbourn. You should follow the footprints and discover if anyone else escaped the sacking of the croft.\n3\tFollow the trail of footprints up the hill\tYou have found a trail of footprints off the side of the road south to Snowbourn. You should follow the footprints and discover if anyone else escaped the sacking of the croft.\n4\tFollow the footprints further up the hill\tYou have found a trail of footprints off the side of the road south to Snowbourn. You should follow the footprints and discover if anyone else escaped the sacking of the croft.\n5\tInvestigate the nearby blood-stained grass\tAt the end of the trail, you have found a patch of blood-stained grass. You should examine the blood to determine its source.\n6\tInspect the fallen Rohirrim\tYou have found a Rohirrim and his steed slain at the end of the trail. You should inspect the warrior's wounds to confirm your suspicions about his attackers.\n7\tTalk to Gísil\tGísil is in the Mead Hall of Garsfeld. You should bring news of what you have found to Gísil.\n",
[9318]="70051531\n1\tTalk to Barliman Butterbur inside the Prancing Pony and learn where you are needed in Bree-land\tThe Prancing Pony is located on the northern side of the town of Bree, atop the hill upon which the town is situated. A guard at the gate of Bree told you to speak with Barliman Butterbur, proprietor of the Prancing Pony, if you wanted to learn where you might go to help the folk of Bree-land.\n2\tTalk to Adso Haybank at his camp on the road west of Bree-town\030Talk to Chief Watcher Grimbriar at his cottage by the road north of Bree-town\030Talk to Celandine Brandybuck in Buckland, west of Bree-town\tAdso Haybank can be found at his camp on the road west of Bree-town, on the way to Buckland. Celandine Brandybuck can be found in Buckland, west of Bree-town and across the river from the Shire. Chief Watcher Grimbriar can be found at a cottage along the road north of Bree-town.\n3\tTalk to Barliman Butterbur inside the Prancing Pony\tThe Prancing Pony is located on the northern side of the town of Bree, atop the hill upon which the town is situated.\n",
[9319]="70034AAB\n1\tSearch west of the cave for a clear route\030Search north of the cave for a clear route\030Search east of the cave for a clear route\tYou should begin your search for a path out of the forest by scouting to the north, west, and east of the hidden cave in the Balewood. Húna has asked you to scout around the cave in hopes of finding a clear route for he and the other refugees of Byre Tor to escape the Balewood.\n2\tTalk to Húna\tHúna can be found in the hidden cave in the southern reaches of the Balewood. You have discovered danger at every turn outside the cave and should now inform Húna that escape is unlikely, at least for the moment.\n",
[9320]="70037BCE\n1\tPatrol the road to Middlemead\tThe road to Middlemead runs along the northern fork of the road west out of Entwade. Kenbert has asked that you patrol the road to Middlemead for the traders that often visited Entwade have not been seen in some time.\n2\tPatrol further along the road to Middlemead\tThe road to Middlemead runs along the northern fork of the road west out of Entwade. You have found naught but a barren road. You should continue your patrol along the road to Middlemead.\n3\tPatrol further along the road to Middlemead\tThe road to Middlemead runs along the northern fork of the road west out of Entwade. You have discovered the remains of the traders' carts, but no sign of the traders. You should continue your patrol.\n4\tTalk to Kenbert\tKenbert can be found near the fork in the road outside the western end of Entwade. You have discovered the remains of traders as well as their destroyed carts and goods. You should return to Kenbert and inform him of this dire news.\n",
[9321]="700431BD\n1\tSearch for the missing courier along the eastern road\tThe couriers of Minas Tirith are known to travel along the eastern road into Lossarnach. Lady Terenis has asked you to search for couriers of Minas Tirith and collect any letters they may bear.\n2\tExamine the fallen courier\tThe slain courier can be found off the side of the road to the south-east of Tumladen. You have discovered a fallen courier along the road into Lossarnach, and should search him for any letters he might yet bear.\n3\tThe letters can be found near the fallen courier in eastern Upper Lebennin. You have noticed a scattered trail of messages dropped by the courier as he fled the Haradrim. You should recover them.\t\n4\tDeliver the letters to Lady Terenis\tLady Terenis can be found in her hall in Tumladen. You have reclaimed the letters dropped by the slain courier, but it is unlikely that any more messages will arrive. You should return to Lady Terenis.\n",
[9322]="70007A77\n1\tTalk to Bram Ashleaf at The Forsaken Inn\030Collect boar-tusks (total: 3)\030Collect wolf-tails (total: 6)\030Collect Orc-shields (total: 4)\tWolves can be found in the Midgewater Pass. Orcs prowl north in the Weather Hills and the Midgewater Pass. Boars wander in Annunlos and the Weather Hills surrounding Weathertop. Bram Ashleaf has asked you to help protect The Forsaken Inn by clearing the threat of wolves, Orcs, and boars from the area surrounding the inn.\n",
[9323]="70037B58\n1\tThe privies can be found throughout Entwade. Womar has asked that you investigate queer noises coming from the privies in Entwade.\t\n2\tTalk to Womar\tWomar can be found atop the raised landing inside the Mead Hall of Entwade. You have searched the privies and found peculiar things, including an Orc and a man who hid away to avoid travelling to Aldburg. You should return to Womar.\n",
[9324]="70000C43\n1\tDeliver the norbog-legs to Hana the Young\030Collect norbog-legs (total: 8)\tNerbyg can be found in Haragmar, the southern reaches of the Red Swamp, in a place called the Circle of Blood. Hana claims that the Woman her people found in the swamp wishes to harm her and uses the nerbyg to call to her and draw her forth from Ost Guruth. Hana has asked you to slay the insects and bring her their legs so that she will know they can no longer call to her.\n",
[9325]="70053E36\n1\tBurn noisome flowers (total: 20)\tNoisome flowers can be found in Rath Dúath. You should burn noisome flowers in Rath Dúath.\n2\tCompleted\tBurned noisome flowers in Rath Dúath.\n",
[9326]="7004744A\n1\tBurn noisome flowers outside Imlad Morgul (total: 6)\tNoisome flowers can be found along the road into Imlad Morgul. Mithrandir has asked you to return to the border of Imlad Morgul and cull the noisome flowers that have begun to spread into Ithilien.\n2\tTalk to Mithrandir at the Camp of the Host\tMithrandir can be found at the Camp of the Host on the border of the Wastes far to the north in North Ithilien. You have burned the noisome flowers outside Imlad Morgul, and you should now return to Mithrandir with news of your success.\n",
[9327]="7002E527\n1\tBring the Tokens of Hytbold to Warin\030Gather Tokens of Hytbold (quantity: see journal)\tThere is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.\n",
[9328]="7002E532\n1\tBring the Tokens of Hytbold to Warin\030Gather Tokens of Hytbold (quantity: see journal)\tThere is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.\n",
[9329]="7002E528\n1\tBring the Tokens of Hytbold to Warin\030Gather Tokens of Hytbold (quantity: see journal)\tThere is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.\n",
[9330]="7002E52E\n1\tBring the Tokens of Hytbold to Warin\030Gather Tokens of Hytbold (quantity: see journal)\tThere is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.\n",
[9331]="7000C0AA\n1\tTalk to Ransroth\tBy completing this quest, you will be considered an Acquaintance of the Rangers of Esteldín.\n",
[9332]="7000C0AB\n1\tTalk to Ransroth\tBy completing this quest, you will be considered a Friend of the Rangers of Esteldín.\n",
[9333]="7000C0AC\n1\tTalk to Ransroth\tBy completing this quest, you will be considered an Ally of the Rangers of Esteldín.\n",
[9334]="7000C0AD\n1\tTalk to Ransroth\tBy completing this quest, you will be considered Kindred to the Rangers of Esteldín.\n",
[9335]="700256CD\n1\tDefeat Legbarthil\tThadúr the Ravager has begun to settle into a farm near Oatbarton. He has begun preparations to release a powerful poison known as Darkthorn into the Shire's water. You must foil Thadúr's plans and defeat him and his minions.\n2\tDefeat Thadúr\tThadúr the Ravager has begun to settle into a farm near Oatbarton. He has begun preparations to release a powerful poison known as Darkthorn into the Shire's water. You must foil Thadúr's plans and defeat him and his minions.\n3\tDestoy Úmheryn, the vile cauldron\030Defeat Thadúr\tThadúr the Ravager has begun to settle into a farm near Oatbarton. He has begun preparations to release a powerful poison known as Darkthorn into the Shire's water. You must foil Thadúr's plans and defeat him and his minions.\n",
[9336]="70025DD4\n1\tTalk to Albin Northcotton\tAlbin Northcotton is at the Northcotton Farm, west of Oatbarton. Northcotton Farm is getting ready for their annual harvest market and could use an extra set of hands.\n",
[9337]="70025DDF\n1\tHelp Rosa Brockhouse get the pies ready\030Help Milo Longfurrow with the chores\030Help Gerard Deephole get the animals ready\030Help Blossom Gamgee prepare the pipe-weed\030Help Nibs and Hal Gamgee with their troubles\tPies need making, chores need doing, animals need tending, pipe-weed needs harvesting, and neighbours need helping before the farmer's market can happen.\n2\tTalk to Albin Northcotton\tAlbin Northcotton is at the Northcotton Farm. Albin Northcotton will be pleased to hear that everything is ready.\n",
[9338]="7000EEC8\n1\tGo to Kauppa-kohta in Forochel and learn of the Gauredain\tForochel lies north of Evendim through Cirith Rhiw, north of Tyrn Fornech. You should start your search in the village of Kauppa-kohta. Tongannel has asked you to go into the frozen North and seek news of the Gauredain.\n",
[9339]="7005977E\n1\tDestroy barricades at Norwarden\tBarricades can be found at Norwarden in the Wildwood. You should destroy barricades at Norwarden.\n2\tDestroy barricades at Norwarden (total: 6)\tBarricades can be found at Norwarden in the Wildwood. You should destroy barricades at Norwarden.\n",
[9340]="7005976F\n1\tDefeat foes at Norwarden\tFoes can be found at Norwarden in the Wildwood. You should defeat foes at Norwarden.\n2\tDefeat foes at Norwarden (total: 8)\tFoes can be found at Norwarden in the Wildwood. You should defeat foes at Norwarden.\n",
[9341]="7006609A\n1\tOristor needs help identifying which trees around the lumber camp are old enough for felling, and which are too young. Examine some trees around the lumber camp.\t\n2\tTalk to Oristor\tYou have finished your survey of the trees, and should report back to Oristor with your findings. Oristor can be found at the lumber camp near Ethring.\n",
[9342]="700216EC\n1\tCollect fake Beakbreaker Ale from The Green Dragon\tBarmy Rootknot, the innkeeper, is at The Green Dragon in Bywater, in the Shire. Óli has requested Beakbreaker Ale, but the Ale Association plans to trick him by delivering 1404 Vintage Reserve instead. You should speak to Barmy Rootknot at The Green Dragon and collect the incorrect wine.\n2\tDeliver the fake Beakbreaker Ale to Óli\tÓli is at Hrimbarg in the Misty Mountains, waiting for Beakbreaker Ale. You should deliver the fake Beakbreaker Ale, actually 1404 Vintage Reserve wine, to Óli before you run out of time.\n",
[9343]="7002651E\n1\tPoison the horse meat and defeat the Black Matron\tThe Warg-matron can be found in the caves of western Nan Curunír. Ondor suggested a way to defeat the Warg-matron, using the deadly spice to subdue her pups by tainting the horse-meat they feed upon.\n2\tTalk to Ondor in Nan Curunír\tOndor is encamped near the caves of western Nan Curunír. You should tell Ondor that the Warg-matron has been defeated.\n",
[9344]="7006C57E\n1\tFind and speak with Nangar in Jirush\tSigênik directed you to return to Nangar. You will likely need to assist Nangar with some tasks involving the other elders in Jirush to ensure your trustworthiness to the outpost.\n2\tComplete all the requests Zidemel has for you\030Complete all the requests Malgat has for you\030Complete all the requests Igbâl has for you\tNangar asked you to work with the other elders in Jirush to gain their favour and respect. You are to visit Zidemel, Malgat, and Igbâl and undertake whatever assistance they require.\n3\tSpeak with Nangar at his home in Jirush\tHaving completed all the requests for the elders in Jirush you should return to Nangar at his home and tell him of all you have done. Nangar's home is south-west of the northern entrance to Jirush.\n",
})
